WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.760
- [Female Announcer] We are
starting the straighten up

00:01.760 --> 00:03.380
and fly right maneuver

00:03.380 --> 00:06.530
where the spacecraft will
jettison the entry balance masses

00:06.530 --> 00:09.240
in preparation for parachute
deploy and to roll over

00:09.240 --> 00:11.593
to give the radar a
better look at the ground.

00:14.369 --> 00:16.693
- [Male Announcer] (indistinct)
indicates shoot deploy.

00:17.811 --> 00:19.380
- [Female Announcer] The
navigation has confirmed

00:19.380 --> 00:20.850
that the parachute has deployed

00:20.850 --> 00:23.640
and we are seeing significant deceleration

00:23.640 --> 00:24.480
in the velocity.

00:24.480 --> 00:27.770
Her current velocity is
450 meters per second

00:27.770 --> 00:29.830
at an altitude of about 12 kilometers

00:29.830 --> 00:31.080
from the surface of Mars.

00:33.290 --> 00:34.847
- [Male Announcer] Heat shield's set.

00:34.847 --> 00:36.100
- [Female Announcer]
Perseverance is now slowed

00:36.100 --> 00:37.680
to subsonic speeds

00:37.680 --> 00:39.630
and the heat shield has been separated.

00:39.630 --> 00:42.090
This allows both the radar and the cameras

00:42.090 --> 00:44.580
to get their first look at the surface.

00:44.580 --> 00:47.530
Current velocity is 145 meters per second

00:47.530 --> 00:50.880
at an altitude of about
nine and a half kilometers

00:50.880 --> 00:52.000
above the surface.

01:08.040 --> 01:09.248
- [Male Announcer] Nav filter converge.

01:09.248 --> 01:11.230
Lastly solution 3.3 meters per second.

01:11.230 --> 01:13.230
Altitude 7.4 kilometers.

01:14.259 --> 01:16.030
- [Female Announcer] Now has
radar lock on the ground.

01:16.030 --> 01:19.450
Current velocity is about
100 meters per second,

01:19.450 --> 01:21.523
6.6 kilometers of the surface.

01:26.190 --> 01:29.100
Perseverance is continuing
to descend on the parachute.

01:29.100 --> 01:32.390
We're coming up on the initialization

01:32.390 --> 01:34.200
of terrain relative navigation

01:34.200 --> 01:36.930
and subsequently the timing
of the landing engines.

01:36.930 --> 01:40.490
Our current velocity is
about 90 meters per second

01:40.490 --> 01:43.143
at an altitude of 4.2 kilometers.

01:47.600 --> 01:49.021
- [Male Announcer] (indistinct)

01:49.021 --> 01:49.854
- [Female Announcer] We have confirmation

01:49.854 --> 01:52.750
that the lander vision system
has produced a valid solution

01:52.750 --> 01:55.000
and part of terrain relative navigation.

01:55.000 --> 01:56.170
- [Male Announcer] (indistinct)

01:56.170 --> 01:57.727
PBA is a nominal.

01:57.727 --> 02:00.633
- [Female Announcer] We have
timing of the landing engine.

02:06.110 --> 02:07.124
- [Male Announcer] Back shelf set.

02:07.124 --> 02:07.957
- [Female Announcer] Current velocity

02:07.957 --> 02:09.690
is 83 meters per second

02:09.690 --> 02:13.630
at about 2.6 kilometers
from the surface of Mars.

02:13.630 --> 02:16.550
We have confirmation that
the back shell has separated.

02:16.550 --> 02:19.170
We are currently performing
the divert maneuver.

02:19.170 --> 02:21.470
Current velocity is about
75 meters per second

02:21.470 --> 02:26.130
at an altitude of about a
kilometer off the surface of Mars.

02:26.130 --> 02:27.703
- [Male Announcer] Here in 50 Bravo.

02:29.251 --> 02:30.370
- [Female Announcer] We have completed

02:30.370 --> 02:32.580
our terrain relative navigation.

02:32.580 --> 02:35.430
Current speed is about
30 meters per second.

02:35.430 --> 02:39.143
Altitude of about 300 meters
off the surface of Mars.

02:41.660 --> 02:44.410
We have started our
constant velocity accordion,

02:44.410 --> 02:47.120
which means we are
conducting the sky crane,

02:47.960 --> 02:49.960
about to conduct the sky crane maneuver.

02:52.500 --> 02:54.000
Sky crane maneuver has started

02:56.260 --> 02:57.953
about 20 meters off the surface.

03:04.470 --> 03:06.247
- [Male Announcer] We're getting
signals from (indistinct).

03:07.380 --> 03:08.987
Tango Delta.

03:08.987 --> 03:11.229
- [Female Announcer] Touchdown confirmed

03:11.229 --> 03:12.062
(crowd cheers)

03:12.062 --> 03:14.379
Perseverance safely on the surface of Mars

03:14.379 --> 03:17.599
ready to begin seeking
the sands of past life.

03:17.599 --> 03:20.182
(crowd cheers)
